Microduck kinematic rig, colour variants, default pose, and the
`microduck.glb` / `kinematics.json` assets in this folder (and the copies
under /public/robot/mjlab) are taken from the official in-browser
simulator:

  https://huggingface.co/spaces/pollen-robotics/microduck-simulator

which itself uses the MJCF / mesh export from pollen-robotics/microduck_rl.

Pollen Robotics software is Apache-2.0. Mechanical and electronic design
files are not open hardware. This landing page is unofficial.

Files kept as close to upstream as possible:

  duck.js        three.js rig (GLB + kinematics.json)
  variants.js    Cream / Graphite / Lavender / Sky materials
  constants.js   joint names, default pose, policy interface
  signed.js      no-op stand-in for the Space JWT helper
